+**Migration**: Drizzle can't express FTS5 in `sqliteTable` portably — create the FTS5
+virtual table with RAW SQL inside your migration `up` (migration shape: `export const
+id = "..."`, `export const up = (tx: Transaction) => Effect.gen(function* () { yield*
+tx.run(sql`CREATE TABLE ...`); yield* tx.run(sql`CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE ...`); ... })`).
+Use the same raw-SQL approach for all four objects to keep one style. Timestamp name:
+`20260821_ctxpack`. Id string `20260821_ctxpack`.
