+FTS maintenance lives in `sql.ts`: create/delete/restore maintain the FTS row in the SAME
+transaction as the domain write via `db.transaction((tx) => ...)`; FTS writes use raw
+parameterized SQL (`tx.run(sql`INSERT INTO ctx_pack_fts ... VALUES (${id}, ${ws}, ${title}, ${keywords}, ${content})`)`).
